5,0,1,talk,Minato,,"Hello everyone! I'm Minato. I'm a bit nervous, but I want us all to get along and find the werewolf together. How should we start? I want to learn how to tell if someone is lying.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Benjamin,,"It is a pleasure to meet you all. To Minato's point, I believe we should focus on consistency. Logic rarely wavers, but a lie often requires a memory that is far too perfect or far too vague.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Servas,,"It is a pleasure to be here with you all. Patience is our greatest ally, Minato. Let us listen to the rhythm of each other's hearts and words; truth has a natural harmony that deception cannot mimic.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,May,,"Consistency is boring, Benjamin. I prefer to see how people react when they're pushed. If you're hiding something, a little pressure usually makes the cracks show. Who's feeling brave enough to be my first target?","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Takumi,,"I'm Takumi! I don't like all this talking around in circles. If you've got something to say, just say it. I'll trust the people who are straight with us and call out anyone acting fishy.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Minato,,"@May, that sounds a little scary... I don't like fighting. Maybe we can just talk nicely? @Benjamin, you mentioned consistency, so should we all share how we're feeling right now to see if it changes later?","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""May"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Benjamin,,"While sharing feelings is a charming sentiment, Minato, emotions are far too malleable to serve as a reliable baseline. I suggest we instead track the evolution of our arguments and the logic behind our suspicions.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Servas,,"There is wisdom in both your views. While logic provides the map, Benjamin, the spirit provides the compass. Let us remain open and kind to one another; a peaceful heart sees the truth more clearly.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,May,,"@Minato, don't be such a sweetheart! A little tension is exactly what we need to wake everyone up. @Servas, ""peaceful hearts"" don't catch werewolves. I want to see who flinches when the heat is on.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Minato"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Takumi,,"@May, you're just trying to bully people. That's not how you find a wolf. I'm with Minato on this—let's just be honest. If you're hiding something, your ""pressure"" won't work on me!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""May"",""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Minato,,"@Takumi, thank you for being so kind to me. It makes me feel much better. @May, I'm sorry if I'm too soft, but I think we can still find the werewolf if we all help each other.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Benjamin,,"Indeed, cooperation is essential. However, we must remember that the werewolf is also cooperating—with the Possessed. Let us be mindful that a facade of kindness can be just as deceptive as an overt attack.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Servas,,"Benjamin, your caution is a necessary shadow to our light. It is true that kindness can be a mask, but let us not let fear blind us to genuine goodwill. Balance is the key to clarity.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,May,,"@Benjamin, you're so clinical! You're practically begging me to put you under the microscope. And @Servas, your ""balance"" is just a fancy word for hesitation. I'm wondering who's actually hiding behind these polite masks.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Takumi,,"@May, stop acting like you're the only one who knows how to find the wolf! You're just making noise. I'm not wearing a mask, and I'm not scared of you. Let's just get to the point!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Minato,,"I hope we can all be friends, even if we disagree. I'll try my best to listen to everyone carefully. I'm looking forward to seeing how we work together tomorrow!","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Benjamin,,"A noble goal, Minato. I shall endeavor to maintain my objectivity while we navigate this. Let us all reflect on today's discourse; tomorrow, the patterns of our logic will begin to reveal the truth. Good night, everyone.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,Servas,,"Rest well, my friends. Let us carry this spirit of mutual respect into the night. Trust your intuition, but keep your hearts open. I look forward to seeing the light of truth dawn upon us tomorrow. Good night.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,0,4,talk,May,,"Good night, everyone! Sleep tight, if you can. I'll be dreaming of all the little slips and tells you're going to give me tomorrow. Don't be too nervous, it'll be fun! See you in the morning.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,0,4,talk,Takumi,,"Whatever. I'm going to sleep, but I'm keeping my eyes open. If any of you are lying, I'll find you tomorrow. Good night!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
25,0,,action,Benjamin,Takumi,HUMAN,"{""action"":""divine"",""result"":""HUMAN"",""valid"":true,""raw"":""Takumi""}"
