31,1,1,talk,Minato,,"Good morning, everyone! I hope you all slept well. I'm a little nervous for today... Does anyone have any clues, or did something happen during the night that we should talk about?","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Good morning, Minato. As the night was silent, we have no casualties to analyze yet. However, the silence itself is a canvas. I am curious to see if anyone's demeanor has shifted since yesterday.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Servas,,"Good morning to you all. The morning air is fresh, and so is our opportunity to find the truth. Let us breathe deeply and approach this day with a calm, steady spirit. Who among us feels a burden on their heart?","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,May,,"@Servas, still with the poetry? It's getting a bit tedious. I'm more interested in who's suddenly acting too quiet or too helpful. @Minato, you're still shaking—is it nerves, or are you hiding something?","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Servas"",""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Takumi,,"@May, leave Minato alone! You're just trying to pick on him because he's nice. If you're so great at finding wolves, why are you just attacking the easiest target? That's totally suspicious!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""May"",""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Minato,,"@May, I'm just a little scared because I don't want to make a mistake... @Takumi, thank you for helping me again. I really appreciate it. Does anyone think they might be the Seer? Maybe they know something?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""May"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Minato, it is often too early for a Seer to reveal themselves; doing so merely paints a target on their back for the werewolf. However, we should observe who is eager to claim the role and who is avoiding it.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Servas,,Benjamin speaks with the wisdom of caution. Let us not rush the Seer into the light before they feel safe. Patience often reveals more than a forced confession. What do you all feel in your intuition?,"{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,May,,"@Benjamin, you're so obsessed with ""observing"" that you're practically hiding in the shadows yourself. @Servas, your intuition is just a smoke screen. If the Seer is hiding, maybe they're just scared of me? Or maybe they're not the Seer at all.","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"@May, you're just talking for the sake of talking! You're attacking everyone but saying nothing useful. It's obvious you're trying to distract us. I'm starting to think you're the one hiding something!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Minato,,"@Takumi, please don't fight! I don't want anyone to be angry. @May, I'm sorry if I'm not helpful, but I'm trying my best. Does anyone else feel like May is being a bit too mean?","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"While May's approach is certainly abrasive, we must be careful not to conflate a difficult personality with a deceptive one. However, Takumi's defense of Minato is notably consistent. I wonder if this protectiveness is genuine or a calculated strategy.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""May"",""Takumi"",""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Servas,,"Benjamin, it is a gentle thing to protect another. Let us not mistake a kind heart for a calculated move. Perhaps Takumi's strength is simply a shield for Minato's fragility. Harmony often hides in plain sight.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Takumi"",""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,May,,"@Benjamin, look at you, suddenly playing detective! How convenient. And @Servas, your ""harmony"" is just making it easier for the wolf to blend in. @Takumi, you're so desperate to be the hero—it's almost cute. Who are you really protecting?","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Servas"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"@May, I'm protecting Minato because you're being a jerk! I don't need a ""strategy"" to be a decent person. You're the only one here acting like a predator, and it's making you look like the wolf!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""May"",""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Minato,,"@Takumi, please don't be too angry... but @May, it makes me sad that you think being nice is a trick. I really want us to find the werewolf together. Who should we vote for? I'm too scared to decide alone.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,"@Minato, there is no need for fear; we simply need a logical basis for our choice. While May's aggression is distracting, Takumi's fervor is also intense. I suggest we evaluate who benefits most from this chaos.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Minato"",""May"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Servas,,"My friends, let us not let the heat of the moment cloud our judgment. Chaos is a storm that obscures the path, but if we remain still, the truth will surface. Perhaps we should consider who is most unsettled by the silence.","{""words"":42,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,May,,"@Benjamin, you're just dancing around the point to look smart. @Servas, your silence is practically a confession. @Takumi, your ""hero"" act is getting old. I say we vote for the one acting most ""perfect."" Who's it going to be?","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Servas"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Takumi,,"@May, you're the only one here who's actually trying to cause chaos! You've spent the whole time attacking everyone else to hide yourself. I'm voting for you because you're acting exactly like a wolf!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
