64,2,1,talk,Minato,,"Oh no... May is gone. I feel really sad that we had to do that, even if she was scary. And Benjamin... he's gone too! This is so frightening. Who could have done this?","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""May"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,2,1,talk,Servas,,It is a heavy morning indeed. To lose two souls in such short order is a tragedy that weighs upon us all. Let us take a deep breath and find our center; fear is a fog that only thickens the darkness.,"{""words"":41,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,2,1,talk,Takumi,,"@Servas, stop with the poetry! We're down to three people and the wolf is still here. Benjamin was the one trying to use logic, and now he's dead. That means the wolf wanted him gone!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Servas"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,2,2,talk,Minato,,"@Takumi, you're right... Benjamin was so smart, it's really scary that he's gone. @Servas, I'm trying to stay calm, but I'm so worried. If the wolf is still here, who can we even trust now?","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Benjamin"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,2,2,talk,Servas,,"Trust is a bridge we build together, Minato. In times of great uncertainty, we must lean on the strength of our bonds. Takumi, your passion is a flame that guides us; let us use it wisely.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Minato"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,2,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Servas, stop trying to be all ""zen"" and actually help! We're out of time for bridges and flames. It's just us three. If you're not the wolf, then you're the only one left who can help me figure this out!","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,2,3,talk,Minato,,"@Takumi, please don't be so mean to Servas... he's just trying to help us stay calm. But I'm really scared. If it's just us three, does that mean the werewolf is definitely one of us?","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,2,3,talk,Servas,,"Indeed, Minato. The circle has grown small, and the shadow is closer than ever. But remember, fear is a thief that steals our clarity. Let us look at each other with honesty and peace.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,2,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Minato, stop being so soft! Yes, the wolf is definitely one of us! @Servas, you're still talking in riddles while we're in danger. If you're human, prove it! Tell me something real, not some poem!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Minato"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,2,4,talk,Minato,,"@Takumi, please don't yell... it makes me even more scared. @Servas, do you have any way to prove you're a good person? I really don't want to vote for the wrong person and lose everyone.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,2,4,talk,Servas,,"My dear Minato, the only proof I can offer is the sincerity of my heart and my desire for your safety. In this twilight, let us trust the kindness we have shared. Takumi, my spirit is steady; I have nothing to hide.","{""words"":42,""mentions"":[""Minato"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,2,4,talk,Takumi,,"@Servas, ""sincerity of heart"" isn't proof! It's exactly what a wolf would say to trick Minato. You've been dodging every direct question since Day 0. I'm not letting you play these games anymore!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Servas"",""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
